   "html": "<p>Nason’s Beer Hall was rebranded as Silo's very own, Level 143, transforming the venue into a themed tattoo shop, amplifying the show’s SDCC presence and Apple TV’s panel announcement of Season 2. </p>\n<p>At the event, which was open to the public, fans received airbrushed tattoos in the style of the show’s characters. Select talent and cast., including Rebecca Ferguson and Steve Zahn, even stopped by for a surprise appearance to get a tattoo and pose for some fan photos.</p>\n<p>‍</p>\n<p>‍</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "tattoo time",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
